WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.138
Structured after-action review.

00:00:02.138 --> 00:00:13.311
Record what you noticed first, which actions you took in sequence, where interruptions occurred, what feedback was most useful and what you want to rehearse next.

00:00:13.311 --> 00:00:20.759
Bring questions or a practical-assessment request to an instructor; this reflection is not a clinical grade.
